      "side": 1,
      "message": "Additionally, regarding `bug_0_length_line.pdf`: Per the PDF spec(8.4.3.3), a 0-length dash with Butt Caps (e.g., [0 10]) should not be rendered. The code artificially clamped 0 to 0.1, which forced it to render incorrectly.",
